      50.64,
      506.94,
      286.43,
      568.64
    ],
    "text": "Allotments of lot No. 385, 386 : depicted in Supplementary No. 24, Topo 4A situated at Yakdewela village Yakdewela G. S. Division Kadawatha Korale Imbulpe Divisional Secretariat, Rathnapura District and Sabaragamuwa Province.",
