  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      379.52,
      544.18,
      499.52
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on which a servitude is to be acquire are here by required appear personally, or by agent duly authorized in writing, before me at Imbulpe Divisional Secretariat on the 06th day of April 2015 At 9.30 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 26th day of March 2015. The nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for the compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude the amount of compensation of such amount.",
